    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mundĭālis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		2. mundus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>worldly, mundane</i> (eccl. Lat.). elementa,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Spect. 9</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sordes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Anim. 54</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">negotia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 43, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">historici,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sulp. Sev. Chron. 2, 14, 6</span></i>
			.—Hence, adv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mundĭālĭter</span></b> ,
				<i>in the manner of the world</i> (eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vivere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Res. Carn. 46</span></i>
			.</div>
